{"version":1,"key":"card:528","content":{"id":528,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有一个美国的电视游戏节目 Let's Make a Deal，参赛者会看见三扇关闭了的门，其中一扇的后面有一辆汽车，另外两扇门后面则各藏有一只山羊，选中了汽车就可以获得该汽车。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当参赛者选定了一扇门但还未打开的时候，节目主持人会打开另外两扇门中包含山羊的那一扇门，然后问参赛者要不要换另一扇仍然关上的门，这就是三门问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"80% 的参赛者都会选择不换，当主持人排除掉一扇门之后，大多数想的是我选的这扇门背后是汽车的概率和另一扇背后是汽车的概率都是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"1/2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果换了，但是自己原来自己选对了，那么会非常的后悔，因此在这种情况下都不会换。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们从数学上进行分析，是否该换，首先定义事件："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设三扇门为 (A, B, C)，奖品随机藏在其中一扇门后，概率均等："},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"P(A) = P(B) = P(C) = \\cfrac{1}{3}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(A) = P(B) = P(C) = \\frac{1}{3}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" "}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参赛者选择门 (A)（选择其他门逻辑相同）。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"主持人知道奖品位置，并会打开一扇无奖品的门（例如打开门 (C)）。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设事件 (H) 表示主持人打开门 (C)。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们需要计算的在打开 C 的情况下 A 后面是汽车的概率 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"P(A|H)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(A|H)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以及在打开 C 的情况下 B 后面是汽车的概率 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"P(B|H)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(B|H)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据贝叶斯定理"}]},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP(A|H) &= \\frac{P(H|A) \\cdot P(A)}{P(H)} \\\\ \nP(B|H) &= \\frac{P(H|B) \\cdot P(B)}{P(H)}\n\\end{aligned}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"阐述各项的含义及值："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"P(H|A)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(H|A)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"：在 A 后面是汽车的情况下打开 C 的概率，因为 B 和 C 后面都是山羊，因此概率是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"1/2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"P(H|B)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(H|B)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"：在 B 后面是汽车的情况下打开 C，这个概率是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"P(H)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(H)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"：根据全概率公式，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"P(H) = P(A)P(H|A) + P(B)P(H|B) = 1/6 + 1/3 = 1/2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(H) = P(A)P(H|A) + P(B)P(H|B) = 1/6 + 1/3 = 1/2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"代入计算可以得到"}]},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP(A|H) &= \\frac{1/2 \\cdot 1/3}{1/2} &= \\frac{1}{3} \\\\\nP(B|H) &= \\frac{1 \\cdot 1/3}{1/2} &= \\frac{2}{3}\n\\end{aligned}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在换的情况下选中汽车的概率是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"2/3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2/3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，不换选中汽车的概率是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"1/3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以策略应当是换。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通俗的理解三门问题，可以把自己选的门和其他的两个门分为两堆，汽车在我选的堆中的概率是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"1/3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在另一堆中是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"2/3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2/3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。现在如果让你按堆换，堆里面有汽车就算中奖，让你换你换不换，肯定换，没有人不换。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在有人说另一堆其中有一个是没中的，这是句废话，并且告诉你哪个没有，等价于把概率从一堆坍缩到了一个，然后问你换不换，你居然不换。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果还是不够直觉，现在假设不是三扇门，而是一百扇门，一个是你选的，另外 99 扇主持人排除了 98 个，问你换不换，你还敢说你选的这扇门有汽车的概率和剩下的一扇门有汽车的概率都还是 1/2 吗？"}]}],"tags":["数学/概率","反直觉"],"createTime":1740825765118,"updateTime":1752404764603,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752404764603}}